WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:16.974
Riley: This was one of those days.

2
00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:19.767
Skyler: When everything goes wrong!

3
00:00:19.768 --> 00:00:26.495
Sarah: At least the sun is coming out.

4
00:00:26.496 --> 00:00:30.321
Skyler: We only wanted to cheer everyone up.

5
00:00:30.322 --> 00:00:33.601
Ben: And instead we made a big mess.

6
00:00:33.602 --> 00:00:35.499
Theo: It's my fault.

7
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:41.813
I shouldn't have let Frankie loose.

8
00:00:41.814 --> 00:00:45.654
Riley: I wanted the Pet Lovers Club to be special.

9
00:00:45.655 --> 00:00:49.533
Riley: I wanted to make people happy!

10
00:00:49.534 --> 00:00:53.136
Theo: Our pets make us happy.

11
00:00:53.137 --> 00:01:07.921
Ben: But they also get us in trouble.

12
00:01:07.922 --> 00:01:09.745
Mrs. Summers: Guess who just called?

13
00:01:09.746 --> 00:01:11.715
Kids: Who?

14
00:01:11.716 --> 00:01:14.724
Mrs. Summers: The doctor from the nursing home.

15
00:01:14.725 --> 00:01:19.513
Theo: Uh-oh. Now we're in trouble.

16
00:01:19.514 --> 00:01:24.194
Mrs. Summers: He told me all the residents are very happy.

17
00:01:24.195 --> 00:01:27.751
Riley: Because it finally stopped raining?

18
00:01:27.752 --> 00:01:31.605
Mrs. Summers: Well, yes, the rain is over.

19
00:01:31.606 --> 00:01:34.656
Mrs. Summers: But there's another reason they are happy.

20
00:01:34.657 --> 00:01:37.913
Ben: Why?

21
00:01:37.914 --> 00:01:42.803
Mrs. Summers: Because they laughed so hard today!

22
00:01:42.804 --> 00:01:47.273
Mrs. Summers: The doctor said they are still laughing!

23
00:01:47.274 --> 00:01:51.253
Riley: You mean they liked our club?

24
00:01:51.254 --> 00:01:55.090
Mrs. Summers: Yes. They want you to come back!

25
00:01:55.091 --> 00:01:57.561
Skyler: I can't believe it!

26
00:01:57.562 --> 00:02:01.868
Mrs. Summers: That's right. The visit really cheered everyone up.

27
00:02:01.869 --> 00:02:06.634
Kids: Yay!

28
00:02:06.635 --> 00:02:09.287
Mrs. Summers: The doctor said something else.

29
00:02:09.288 --> 00:02:12.180
Ben: What's that, Mrs. Summers?

30
00:02:12.181 --> 00:02:15.958
Mrs. Summers: He said laughter is the best medicine in the world!

31
00:02:15.959 --> 00:02:21.078
Mrs. Summers: And he said thank you to the Pet Lovers Club!
